The general public doesn’t like Chequers’ plan, the opposition won’t vote in favor and is not popular among our party and our activists, who are the ones who actually take to the streets and vote for us in the first place.
Forget Chequers and start listening.”
In a message addressed to May, he added: The prime ministers hold their positions when they fulfill their promises.”
