However, instead of sending it to her husband, she sent it to Maurice twice.
After realizing her blunder, an “uncomfortable” Plasco-Flaxman fired Maurice by claiming that her former nanny, who was African-American, had done a lousy job and instead awaited a Filipina, according to the New York Post.
